usage:
For attachments and imports. State the accepted types and the size limit on the zone itself — not in a help article the user will never open. The part only lists files; your code keeps or uploads them:

```js
document.addEventListener('kata-file-upload-add', event => {
  console.log(event.detail.files);
});
```
Use kata-file-upload-remove (detail.name) for removals. The part does not check types or sizes; validate in your code.
